{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Steam WorkShop supported.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Action files can be imported.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >--Model operation--</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drag the model with the middle mouse button,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scroll the wheel to zoom the model</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Right-click to pop up the menu. </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >-- Functional interface --</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The tray icon has functions such as changing models and adding models.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Workshop can be opened through the system tray icon.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play Animation</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drag the action file onto the model to play it directly. Supports Mixmo's Fbx for Unity (*.fbx) format files.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drag the VMD format action file onto the model to play the action, and drag the MP3 file onto the model to associate music.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3409980?t=1756134364","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3409980?t=1756134364","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3409980/58cde63cf0e5c37950988c8b278c4ed2df1cda25/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756134364","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3409980/58cde63cf0e5c37950988c8b278c4ed2df1cda25/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756134364","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Workshop","id":30},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Steam WorkShop supported.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Action files can be imported.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >--Model operation--</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drag the model with the middle mouse button,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scroll the wheel to zoom the model</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Right-click to pop up the menu. </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >-- Functional interface --</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The tray icon has functions such as changing models and adding models.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Workshop can be opened through the system tray icon.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play Animation</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drag the action file onto the model to play it directly. Supports Mixmo's Fbx for Unity (*.fbx) format files.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drag the VMD format action file onto the model to play the action, and drag the MP3 file onto the model to associate music.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Megu Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3409980/d5e6561cb850ecde4c8cf176c527e68f34f8a6cd/header.jpg?t=1756134364","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3409980/202797276/9fdeca36a9f0887f9bf7677832828f6afbc8abe3/1756132717/dash_av1.mpd?t=1756133362","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3409980/202797276/9fdeca36a9f0887f9bf7677832828f6afbc8abe3/1756132717/dash_h264.mpd?t=1756133362","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3409980/202797276/9fdeca36a9f0887f9bf7677832828f6afbc8abe3/1756132717/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1756133362","id":257114898,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/s